Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.01,0:00:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我的制片人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想跟我谈，先过他这关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to talk to me, you go through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。看来你就是我的新二把手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice work. I guess that means you're my new Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你聪明，口齿伶俐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're smart. You're articulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:16.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，你样样都行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you've got it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:18.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么突然说这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.29,0:00:20.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我有严重的恋父情结。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I have major daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我可能爱上你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I may be falling in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还想要孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I want children.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有过机会，是你自己搞砸的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You had your chance, and you blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们把整起枪击案都怪在你头上？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're blaming the whole shooting on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们毁了你的职业生涯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They blew up your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.83,0:00:33.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你为什么还关心？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我是记者。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个跳楼的女人玛丽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That woman Mary who jumped off the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:37.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去年……那是谋杀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}last year... That was a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的消息来源是谁？  -杰瑞米。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Who's your source?   -Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.17,0:00:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有他的录音。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got him on tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想合作？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to work together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:42.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这篇报道将无人能挡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This piece will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你一步一步地给我们讲清楚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to walk us through it, step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们撒了谎，我们掩盖了真相，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We lied. We covered it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们当时就该直接逮捕我们，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they should have just arrested us,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.12,0:00:50.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们害死了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause we killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我得告诉你一件事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这跟节目无关。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Th is not about the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.32,0:00:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是关于我和我妈……我被人强奸了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's about me and my mom... That I was raped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在她家，被她的一个病人，那时我12岁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}by one of her patients at her house when I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:58.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可她却怪我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And she blamed me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:00:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她在保护她的诊所。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because she was protecting her practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:02.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管别人怎么说，是我们害死了她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No matter what anybody else says, we killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩也有份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And also Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，就是她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, she's the one that told me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.21,0:01:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫我什么都别说，你知道的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not to say anything, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:19.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为大家总是想让我闭嘴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because everybody's always trying to shut me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，可你知道我那时根本不知情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, but you know that I didn't even know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.42,0:01:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是事实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.92,0:01:26.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.32,0:01:27.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们经常报警的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We call the cops, like, all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报警？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Call the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:29.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，我们经常报。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, we call them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:31.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩……我是说，就是她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn... I mean, she's the one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:32.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫我什么都别说的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that told me not to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.89,0:01:34.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我就听她的了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and so I listened to her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:36.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为她叫我别告诉任何人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because she told me not to tell anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽的事，我们本该早点报警的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should have called the police a lot sooner with Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿。  -那是什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.   -What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.51,0:01:48.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……这就是我们要的故事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um... this is our story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是拦车那段\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not the car pullover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不是警察干了什么，都不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or what the cops did, none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:55.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是这个。《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's this. "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:56.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个这种卑劣的文化……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole despicable culture...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:01:58.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欺骗、谎言、背后捅刀，还有掩盖真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The deceit, the lies, back-stabbing, and cover-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:01:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。我……科尔曼，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I-I... Coleman,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:01.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该说这些的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shouldn't have said any of this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。瑞秋……不，你必须说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh. Rachel... No, you had to,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:04.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你是个好人，而且……我……听着，我们得把这个删掉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because you're a good person, and... I... Listen, we have to erase this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:06.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这删不掉的，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's no erasing this, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.36,0:02:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我需要……  -这东西不会流出去的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I need...   -This isn't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我不会那么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会去搞垮这个节目的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna, like, take down the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不会那样对奎恩。  -瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm not doing that to Quinn.   -Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。我们该怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No way. How do we do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。“敬奎恩”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh. "To Quinn."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.73,0:02:15.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我该怎么……呃，我该怎么删掉这个？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How do I... Um, how do I erase this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是惊讶她怎么就这么摆布你，瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It just amazes me how she just plays you, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:18.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想，见过你母亲之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I guess after meeting your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.67,0:02:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不该这么惊讶的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I shouldn't be so surprised at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.91,0:02:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说见过我母亲是什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean by meeting my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是那个意思……我是说奎恩很聪明。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't mean... I'm saying Quinn is smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.68,0:02:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。她假装关心你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm. And she pretends to care about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:28.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}时不时给一点点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just a little bit here and there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:31.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为她知道你需要，因为你是人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just 'cause she knows you need it, because you're human.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}瑞秋，如果她真的关心你，她会怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, what would she do if she actually cared about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.46,0:02:38.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会让你赶紧离开这鬼地方，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'd have you get the hell out of this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为这会毁了你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because it's killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩在毁掉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn is killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你刚才自己说的……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said it yourself right there...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:45.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有的事都指向她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All roads lead back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.47,0:02:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必须揭穿她的真面目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to expose her for who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的觉得不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just really don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.54,0:02:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们其实不需要做什么。我不同意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that we need to do anything, actually. I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科尔曼，感觉你只是担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman, it just feels like you're concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.84,0:02:53.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的职业生涯，我理解……我确实担心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about your career, which I understand... I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.77,0:02:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我在这儿跟你说，你会找到别的工作的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I'm here to tell you that you will get another job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这……不，瑞秋，你说得太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is... No, Rachel, you couldn't be more right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:59.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实很担心我的职业生涯，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so concerned about my career,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为所有这些疯狂的事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because all this crazy shit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会想把一切都推到我头上。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna try and pin it on me, everything. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但她也会想把一切推到你头上。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But she's gonna try to pin it on you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看不出来吗？天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't see that? Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们杀了人，所以他们会说你疯了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They killed someone, so they'll say you were crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:14.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你进过精神病院，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you were in a mental institution,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:15.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会随便编...\N{\rEN\blur0.8}they'll say whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们会不择手段。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll do whatever they have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.56,0:03:19.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由你决定，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's up to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:22.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们需要证据扳倒Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but we need evidence to take Quinn down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.77,0:03:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的决定。你必须选。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's your decision. You have to choose.
