Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我想回来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I want back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.35,0:17:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你需要点东西\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, you need something
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能撑起一整集的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that you can build an episode on,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个明天大家都会谈论的瞬间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a moment that people will be talking about tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:36.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我认得这表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的目标是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's your target?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，真Rachel对辣Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Real Rachel versus Hot Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.49,0:17:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放手去做吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是想告诉你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I just wanted to tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:17:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius打听到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that Darius found out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.85,0:18:01.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最爱吃的是刺身，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that your favorite food is sashimi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，他点了你最爱的那道菜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, and he ordered your favorite dish
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从你最爱的那家餐厅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from your favorite restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西宫寿司？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sushi Nishi-Ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.22,0:18:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}西宫寿司，黄尾鱼，葱花，柚子醋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sushi Nishi-Ya, yellowtail, scallion, ponzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-天哪，真的？  -真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, my God, really?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:10.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他真贴心。  -真贴心。是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-That is so sweet of him.   -So sweet of him. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我觉得他只是想要点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, actually, I think he just wants something
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你真的会吃的东西。  -嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-that you'll actually eat.   -Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道Tiffany\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you know about Tiffany
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.60,0:18:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和她那些沙拉的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and her whole thing with the salads?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.76,0:18:18.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，知道……生羽衣甘蓝，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah... raw kale,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:19.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两勺酱汁放旁边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}2 tablespoons of dressing on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:20.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，是一勺。很疯吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's 1 tablespoon. Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之，他们今天约会了。糟透了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyways, they had a date today. It was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:25.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是在找一个能一起吃饭，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's just looking for someone he can eat with,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能做自己的人，所以施展你的魅力吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}be himself with, so work your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那条白裙子……完美。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The white dress... Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-谢谢，Rachel。  -随时。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Thank you, Rachel.   -Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.18,0:18:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.48,0:18:37.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太开心了，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were way too happy, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.48,0:18:38.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个小滑头在打什么主意？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is your sneaky, little ass up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.82,0:18:40.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不知道啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.49,0:18:43.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是在制作电视节目而已，二号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just, like, producing a TV show, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梦想成真。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Living the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-干杯。  -干杯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Cheers.   -Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.63,0:18:49.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-敬美好的夜晚。  -敬初次约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-To a wonderful evening.   -To a first date.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.36,0:18:52.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坏女孩。你知道你不该上来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bad girl. You know, you shouldn't be up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:56.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael能在泳池边晚餐跳舞，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael gets dinner and dancing by the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就只能打高尔夫？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I get golf?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这算什么，开玩笑吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is this, some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}约会都是Darius选的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Darius gets to pick the dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.51,0:19:06.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们早该这么做了，说真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We should have done this well before now, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.65,0:19:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在想办法引起你的注意，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I've been trying to get your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但节目就是这样，你懂的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's just the way the show is, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:16.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那倒是能引起他的注意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that would get his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经过昨晚……Darius应该\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And after last night... Darius should be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跪着求我和他在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on his knees begging me to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.93,0:19:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}任何脑子正常的男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Any guy in his right mind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.53,0:19:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都愿意付出一切只求尝你一口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would give his left nut for a taste of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:33.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}某人好几周没吃饭了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone hasn't eaten in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想尝一口吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你，呃，想加入吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you, uh, want to get in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:55.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不吃生鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not get down with the raw fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:20:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这份照烧鸡肉我可以。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I will get down on this chicken teriyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。不得不说，我喜欢你吃东西的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Got to say, I love the way you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在法国南部待过一阵子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spent some time in the south of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.91,0:20:08.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那儿吃饭是非常感官的体验。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eating there is a very sensual experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-所以……  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-So...   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.51,0:20:12.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我调了很特别的酱汁。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I prepared a very special sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哎哟。  -然后呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh-oh.   -And?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.68,0:20:15.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续看。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}啊，看你的表情！看你的表情！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, look at your face! Look at your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪，你回来真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, it's good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:23.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，你在法国还做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what else did you do while you were France?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.59,0:20:25.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，失陪了，我得走了，二号。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, excuse me, got to run, Number Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦不，你又来了。  -真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, no. You're back there.   -Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:35.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你听到了吗？  -听到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Did you hear that?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.40,0:20:37.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪！停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.84,0:20:45.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}日落时分，达瑞斯和雅尔将共舞一曲，性感迷人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius and Yael will share a sensuous dance as the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.71,0:20:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你先请。  -谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-After you.   -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:51.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我扶着你，扶着你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.39,0:20:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-需要帮忙吗？  -是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Need a hand?   -Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。可以吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:00.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天堂里的夜晚真美啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What a beautiful evening in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我一分钟。别动，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me a minute. Don't move, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。哦，哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上回来。就一小会儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be right back. Just need a quick minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.64,0:21:09.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们休息五分钟。  -我们不会休息五分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We're taking five.   -We're not gonna take five.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:11.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，就几分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweetie, it's just gonna be a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的，我们只剩几秒钟了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweetie, we have a few more seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.87,0:21:14.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你美极了。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You look amazing. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是那个。我真的要去洗手间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not that. I really have to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她看起来很痛苦。身心俱疲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She looks distressed. Of mind and body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:19.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们真的要没光线了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are really about to lose the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:21.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能把拐杖还给我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I have that cane back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好。好，没问题。  -准备好，开始……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay. Yeah, okay.   -Get ready, here we go...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主要是身体。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mostly body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.12,0:21:25.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们怎么不为她停一下？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why aren't they breaking for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说……瑞秋，能切吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean... Rachel, can you cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看，这才叫“敬业”，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, that's what you call "Commitment," people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧！开机！把摇臂推过来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go! Roll camera! Let's get that crane in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-拜托，伙计们。  -继续拍，伙计们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Come on, guys.   -Keep rolling, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-继续拍，伙计们。  -开始了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Keep rolling, guys.   -Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.36,0:21:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-准备，开拍！  -呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ready, and action!   -Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:38.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 那深处……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* The depths...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:39.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你还好吗？  -嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you okay?   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:41.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 你所拥有的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* That you possess
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:44.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦！你指甲好尖！  -哦，抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ooh! You have nails!   -Oh, I'm sorry.
