Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.77,0:26:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我不想再让自己出丑了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't want to make a fool out of myself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.87,0:26:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就别。听着，如果你真的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So don't. Look, if you truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.87,0:26:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}百分之百投入……我是说，看看你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}100% committed... I mean, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.27,0:26:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那根本就不是竞争。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wouldn't even be a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你不想输，那就赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you don't want to be a loser, then win.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.99,0:26:32.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在《永恒》这里，今天是漫长又紧张的一天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been a long and stressful day here at "Everlasng."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.66,0:26:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“紧张的一天。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Stressful day."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.69,0:26:36.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他干什么了，打盹和打飞机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's he been doing, napping and whacking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.36,0:26:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius和Chantal试图在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius and Chantal try to find peace and love
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.70,0:26:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}热水浴缸里寻找平静与爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}here in the hot tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么他说什么都这么猥琐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why does everything he say sound so creepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.84,0:26:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:48.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自从“屎门事件”之后，一切都让人失望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}everything is just a letdown ever since Shitgate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.08,0:26:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，Chantal来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, here comes Chantal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她又会对他百般讨好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's just gonna fawn all over him
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.31,0:26:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带着她那处女模样和死过未婚夫的姿态，又来一遍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with her virginal, dead-fiancéd self, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:26:59.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我觉得她今晚会让你吃惊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I think she might surprise you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.35,0:27:01.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她今晚会让所有人吃惊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she might surprise everyone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:04.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Darius，我想了很多，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Darius, I've been doing a lot of thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.82,0:27:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于我是谁，你是谁，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about who I am, and who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.43,0:27:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有我在《永恒》这里做的一切，还有……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and what I've been doing here at "Everlasting" and...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有你早餐吃了什么，为什么穿这件浴袍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what you had for breakfast, and why you wore this robe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.36,0:27:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有话要对你说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have something I need to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.47,0:27:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！姑娘脱光了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Girl is naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不再躲藏了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not hiding anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.11,0:27:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，嘿……眼睛看上面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey... Eyes up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.34,0:27:28.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，那是全裸！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, that is butt-naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.95,0:27:32.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.25,0:27:34.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。等等……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.79,0:27:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁，你把Chantal怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you, and what have you done with Chantal?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，可不是嘛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.86,0:27:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得是时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it's about time
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.89,0:27:40.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你认识真正的我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you got to know the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.83,0:27:43.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.73,0:27:45.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓屌！好耶！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Penis grab! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那玩意儿我们洗过吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do we ever clean that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:49.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每次Graham出来就洗。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Every time Graham gets out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.20,0:27:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ohh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:55.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看。她是来赢的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at that. She's in it to win it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.31,0:27:57.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好，Madison。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great job, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:28:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和Rachel今晚真是拼了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You and Rachel really brought it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.41,0:28:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干得好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.05,0:28:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对Yael使的那招\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That thing you pulled on Yael
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.08,0:28:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们以前怎么没使过？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why have we never done that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.79,0:28:10.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个疯狂的天才。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are a mad genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.06,0:28:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，你是说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, you're telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.92,0:28:14.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你整个职业生涯都没使过那招？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your entire career you've never done that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.53,0:28:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从来没有，现在，我简直无法想象不使这招。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never, and now, like, I can't even imagine not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.20,0:28:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这可能是我们做过最恶劣的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it might be the worst thing that we have ever done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.14,0:28:25.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们俩都知道那不是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, we both know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.10,0:28:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你得放下了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you have to let that go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:29.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mnh-mnh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从来不想Mary的事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't ever think about Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.78,0:28:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想。我晚上还想睡得着，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I like to sleep at night, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.38,0:28:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你太在意了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You care too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.95,0:28:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像那一个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like that one...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.78,0:28:40.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我只是觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I just think
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.25,0:28:41.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做过的事真的很难释怀。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's really hard to live with what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.92,0:28:45.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先，我们什么都没做，是夏亚做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, first of all, we didn't do anything, Shia did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.09,0:28:47.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽已经死了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们改变不了这个事实。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There was nothing that we could do to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.43,0:28:52.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们掩盖了真相。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we covered it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.13,0:28:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直在掩盖事情！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cover things up all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.47,0:28:57.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我的工作。你真以为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my job. I mean, do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.27,0:28:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那出被警察拦车的戏码\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that your whole car pullover stunt
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.54,0:29:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么神奇地消失了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just went away like magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}噗！拜拜！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poof! Buh-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.48,0:29:07.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当时因盗窃汽车罪还在缓刑期，记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were on probation for grand theft auto, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.18,0:29:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你谎报车辆被盗，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You called in a false report of a stolen car,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.28,0:29:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还害得一个人中枪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you got a guy shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.15,0:29:15.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不是我，你现在早进监狱了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If it wasn't for me, you'd be in prison right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.86,0:29:18.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}监狱，铁窗后面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prison. Behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.19,0:29:19.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么做到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.83,0:29:23.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有很多朋友和一大笔钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a lot of friends and a pile of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.46,0:29:28.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得我们需要十万美元的“绿幕”预算\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really think we need $100,000 "Greens" budget
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.23,0:29:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我们还是在天天降雨的马林县拍摄？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when we shoot in Marin county where it rains every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.84,0:29:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇，真不敢相信你，呃，为我做了这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, I can't believe that you, uh, you did that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.98,0:29:40.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你我的区别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the difference between you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.21,0:29:43.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把自己在乎的人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I limit the number of people that I care about
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.88,0:29:47.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}限制在大概两个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to, like, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.15,0:29:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.39,0:29:51.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说到其中一个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Speaking of one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-布斯的屁股？  -嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Booth booty?   -Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.89,0:29:55.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他正开车到别墅，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's pulling up to the mansion,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.86,0:29:58.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他什么事都喜欢发短信告诉我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he likes to text me about everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.23,0:30:00.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}用他那个花哨的小手表电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from his, like, fancy, little watch-phone thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-很老土。  -很可爱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's very corny.   -Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.60,0:30:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你们俩是认真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it's, like, real between the two of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.30,0:30:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}知道吗？我们得走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? We have got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.91,0:30:15.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得准备淘汰仪式。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an elimination ceremony to prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.25,0:30:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯！我不想走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm! I don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.92,0:30:21.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎回来，戈德堡。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome back, Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有你在的时候有意思多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's much more entertaining when you're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.56,0:30:29.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-回来真好。  -走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-It's good to be back.   -Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.10,0:30:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那“优雅退出”是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what happened to "bowing out gracefully"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.67,0:30:41.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，得了吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.14,0:30:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该为自己感到羞耻。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You ought to be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.11,0:30:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了现金奖金出卖我，真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Selling me out for a cash bonus, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.31,0:30:47.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不不不，亲爱的，事情不是那样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no, no, honey. That is not how it went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.98,0:30:50.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我是在帮你。  -行了，省省吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-I am trying to help you.   -Okay, save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.05,0:30:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你低估我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You underestimated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.25,0:30:53.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是那种没脑子的选美女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not some airhead pageant girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.22,0:30:55.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢达瑞斯，但如果他想淘汰我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like Darius, but if he wants to cut me,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他可以亲自在全国电视上这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he can do it himself on national television.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.49,0:31:00.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我听说了雅艾尔约会时发生的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I heard about what happened on Yael's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.53,0:31:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得我机会很大。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I like my chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.03,0:31:07.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是啊。  -我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.27,0:31:09.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what is happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.57,0:31:12.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些金色窗帘是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What is with these gold curtains?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.60,0:31:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别让我开始说。走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't even get me started. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.61,0:31:17.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-哦……  -哎呀，还有人是臭臭的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Ohh...   -Uh-oh, is someone still stinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.61,0:31:20.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太过分了，蒂芙妮，太过分了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that is cold, Tiffany, cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}- 来个全景。 -\N{\rEN\blur0.8}- Let's get a wide shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么？那是什么表情？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? What's that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.42,0:31:26.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.15,0:31:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别告诉我你改主意了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tell me you're having second thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.02,0:31:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不想毁掉性感瑞秋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about destroying Hot Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:30.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有改主意，没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No second thoughts, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.32,0:31:33.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。很好。行。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Good. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.22,0:31:34.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家，开始吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get this party started, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:39.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国观众们，我们只剩下三位……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, America, we are down to three...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.97,0:31:43.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香塔尔、蒂芙妮和雅艾尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Chantal, Tiffany, and Yael.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.40,0:31:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}达瑞斯会让谁回家？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who will Darius send home?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}舞台交给你，达瑞斯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stage is yours, Darius.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.65,0:31:59.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅艾尔，对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.08,0:32:01.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我就是看不到我们在一起的未来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I just can't see us being together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:03.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.72,0:32:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢这过去的八周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for the past eight weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.19,0:32:07.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我学到了很多。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've learned so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.19,0:32:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不会忘记在《永恒》的时光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never forget my time here at "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.60,0:32:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会忘！没人会忘，雅艾尔，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one will! No one will, Yael,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.10,0:32:15.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我们会播出\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because we are going to broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.47,0:32:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你那场烂透了的腹泻盛宴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}your crap-tastic diarrhea-fest
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.77,0:32:20.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}循环播放，直到我死的那天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a loop until the day I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.21,0:32:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常感谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.21,0:32:26.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的雅艾尔。唉，算了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor Yael. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.14,0:32:27.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就剩两个了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then there were two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.61,0:32:29.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，这给\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it kind of brings back a whole, new meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.75,0:32:31.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“淘汰仪式”赋予了全新的含义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to "Elimination Ceremony."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.72,0:32:34.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你考虑过我说的话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, so, you thought about what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.09,0:32:35.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我仔细想过你说的话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I thought a lot about what you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.62,0:32:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也想过我们过去几周\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and a lot about what we've done
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.79,0:32:40.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做的那些事，我只是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over the last couple of weeks, and I am just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.76,0:32:42.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会搞垮这个节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna take down the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会搞垮奎恩，只因为你想要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna take down Quinn just because you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弄个项目来启动自己的事业\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like, some kind of project to jump-start your career
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.53,0:32:48.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这才是这一切的……  -不。不是……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-and that's what this all...   -No. That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.40,0:32:50.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是！我向你保证，不是这样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, it is! I promise you, that's not what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.47,0:32:51.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-瑞秋……  -结束了，科尔曼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Rachel...   -It's over, Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.77,0:32:53.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不，还没结束。  -不，已经结束了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, it's not over.   -Yes, it is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.34,0:32:54.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是为了……这是为了正义。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is about... This is about justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.74,0:32:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她对自己做过的事毫无悔意，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She has no remorse for the things she's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.28,0:32:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她自己也承认了。  -什……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-and she admits as much.   -Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.51,0:32:59.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.58,0:33:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有很多朋友和一大笔钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a lot of friends and a pile of cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.31,0:33:04.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.18,0:33:06.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真觉得我们需要十万美元的“绿幕”预算？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really think we need $100,000 "Greens" budget?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:08.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么弄到的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.39,0:33:10.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认识几个黑客，他们教了我，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know some hackers, and they taught me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:12.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我监听了你的手机，打开了麦克风……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I tapped your phone, turned on the mike...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.29,0:33:14.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—你监听了我手机？  -—是的。我这么做是为了……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-You tapped my phone?   -Yes. I did this for...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.09,0:33:15.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……等等，不好意思……你监听了我手机？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You... Wait, excuse me... You tapped my phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.69,0:33:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，我做了。我知道这对你很难，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, I did. I knew it would be hard for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.70,0:33:19.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我们需要这种证据。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we need this kind of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.60,0:33:22.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会让你替她的行为买单，绝对不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna let you pay for her actions, I'm just not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.10,0:33:25.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经开始把这个剪进我们的片子里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I started cutting this into our piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.17,0:33:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗯。  -—效果特别好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh-huh.   -It plays so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.47,0:33:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我们需要的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.78,0:33:35.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！拜托，拜托！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.71,0:33:38.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这个，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是这个。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。那我们怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.76,0:33:47.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就……扳倒她，而不是我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We just, like, take her down instead of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.76,0:33:50.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—对！  -—对。好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes!   -Yes. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.50,0:33:52.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一开始就告诉过你……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you right from the start...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:53.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已经超越她了，你不需要她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You've outgrown her, you don't need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.13,0:33:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—这……  -—是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-This...   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.47,0:33:56.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们的未来，你和我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is our future, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.74,0:33:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还找到了一家机构。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I found a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:00.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？什么样的机构？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah? And what kind of place?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.84,0:34:02.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是让你恢复健康的地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's for you to get healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以在那里好好梳理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you can work things out
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.61,0:34:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟一个不是你母亲的治疗师。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a therapist who isn't your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.21,0:34:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要把这些都谈开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just need to talk this stuff through.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.58,0:34:09.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你终于可以好好休息了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can finally just rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.22,0:34:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—哦，哇。  -—然后……就放松。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, wow.   -And just... just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是住院式疗程。先住一个月……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a residential program. A month to start...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.75,0:34:17.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在真的……好感动，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, so touched right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.69,0:34:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太感谢你了，Coleman。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and thank you so much, Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.69,0:34:22.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉，我之前……吃醋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, like, so sorry that I was, like, getting jealous
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.69,0:34:25.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了Yael发疯，我太抱歉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and acting all crazy about Yael, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.33,0:34:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—可你只是……  -—别，别说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-But you were just...   -Don't, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.33,0:34:28.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全说得对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.67,0:34:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的是唯一一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're, like, truly the only person
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正在乎我的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that, like, actually cares about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.60,0:34:36.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想让你快乐、健康、完完整整。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want you to be happy and healthy and whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.41,0:34:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.35,0:34:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会好起来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗯。  -—你会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mm.   -You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.55,0:34:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们就把这地方烧个精光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then we are gonna burn this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.19,0:34:52.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，一定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.59,0:34:56.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们就能过上我们都该有的生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then we're gonna have the life that we both deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.93,0:34:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Rachel，片场需要你！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rachel, we need you on set!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:01.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，给我……几分钟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, just give me, like, a few minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.24,0:35:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我再下去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before I head down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.47,0:35:06.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—好，好，好。  -—真抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah, yeah, yeah.   -I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.91,0:35:08.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.21,0:35:09.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—嗯。  -—谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah.   -Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.34,0:35:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.86,0:35:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.20,0:35:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离开这里！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Getting out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Yael……嘿！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yael... hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:35.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们不会让你离开的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They are not gonna let you leave here
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.83,0:35:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要等决赛之后，所以我……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}till after the finale, so we ne...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.44,0:35:38.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他们告我啊！我不在乎！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let 'em sue me! I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.77,0:35:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些人都疯了！我不待在这儿了！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These people are insane! I'm not staying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.44,0:35:42.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，别，别。深呼吸，深呼吸，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, no, no. Just take a breath, take a breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.31,0:35:43.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我已经有扳倒他们的一切了，真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause I have everything we need to take them down, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.98,0:35:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你给我的Jeremy那些东西，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The stuff you gave me from Jeremy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在又把Rachel拉回来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have Rachel back on board right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.68,0:35:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就差这一步了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are this close right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.31,0:35:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要让他们为一切付出代价。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna make them pay for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这里不安全。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am not safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.75,0:35:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到他们对我做了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see what they did to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.39,0:35:55.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到Rachel做了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see what Rachel did?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.22,0:35:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-—是，我很抱歉。  -—她给我下毒了，Coleman！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yeah. I'm sorry.   -She poisoned me, Coleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.56,0:35:59.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到处都是摄像头！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are cameras everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.73,0:36:06.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想来恭喜你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to congratulate you
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.86,0:36:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进入最后两强，还有把这个给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on making the final two and give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.60,0:36:14.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.48,0:36:20.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.55,0:36:26.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件首饰可真幸运。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is one lucky piece of jewelry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.78,0:36:28.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.99,0:36:32.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，这些……这些女人都是有创伤的、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, these... These women are damaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.42,0:36:33.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疯狂又孤独的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}crazy, lonely people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.59,0:36:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们必须伤害别人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They have to hurt other people
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.39,0:36:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}操纵别人，才能让自己好受一点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and manipulate them to make themselves feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.46,0:36:40.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再也不会有人用同样的眼光看我了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one will ever look at me the same way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.57,0:36:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，天哪，不会的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.43,0:36:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，不，不会的，因为你很漂亮，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, that's not true because you're beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.04,0:36:47.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你聪明，你是个好人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you're smart, and you're a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.54,0:36:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且你性感得要命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're sexy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.91,0:36:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会让他们付出代价的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna get them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.38,0:36:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.38,0:36:56.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.99,0:37:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好……对，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All ri... Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.50,0:37:14.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在听，我在听。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am here. I am listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，现在……现在正是好时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, it's a... It's a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.47,0:37:17.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正是最合适的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.61,0:37:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I... Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.85,0:37:38.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，医生。我明白。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, Doctor. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.53,0:37:43.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。我没事。嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I'm fine. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.86,0:37:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.57,0:37:49.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn，怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.64,0:37:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我本来就不想要孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never even wanted to have kids anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.94,0:38:02.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，不管这是什么问题，我们都能应付。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, whatever this thing is, we can manage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.05,0:38:04.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有资源。肯定有什么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have resources. There must be some...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.65,0:38:06.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有什么东西能买来治好它吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's something you can buy to fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.55,0:38:07.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有。结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There isn't. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.96,0:38:12.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.09,0:38:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.46,0:38:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着，我们不如……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, look, why don't we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.03,0:38:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不如明天再谈这件事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't we talk about this tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.13,0:38:20.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没必要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.77,0:38:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是认真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.70,0:38:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你连试都不愿意试着想办法解决？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't even want to try to figure this thing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.77,0:38:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么好想的，蠢货。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is nothing to figure out, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.37,0:38:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要孩子，可我生不了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want kids, and I can't have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.81,0:38:33.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以滚出我的生活。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So get the hell out of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:35.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在真的不认识你是谁了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't really don't know who you are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.38,0:38:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我认识你是谁……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I know who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个想要什么就能得到什么的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A guy who gets everything he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:46.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我不会成为任何人的失望。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I won't be anybody's disappointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:53.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Quinn，求你了。Quinn！  -我还有工作要做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quinn, please. Quinn!   -I have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.60,0:38:56.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的要让我就这么走吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you really gonna let me walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.04,0:39:05.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有人，出去。出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everybody, get out. Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.72,0:39:24.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Quinn，怎么了……  -出去！马上！走！快点！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quinn, what is...   -Get out! Now! Go! Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of here!!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.00,0:40:00.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会告诉你什么时候结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one ever tells you when it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.87,0:40:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人会跑到你工作的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one ever shows up at your work
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.11,0:40:13.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对你说："嘿，就是现在了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and says, "Hey, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.98,0:40:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你生孩子的最后机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is your last chance to have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.11,0:40:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得呢，Quinn？"\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think, Quinn?"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.05,0:40:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要孩子吗，Quinn？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want kids, Quinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.65,0:40:22.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要的是选择！！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted a choice!!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.92,0:40:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要一个选择。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.23,0:40:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你离开这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.53,0:40:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得走，趁你还来得及。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got to go, okay, while you still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:42.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧，去找那个混蛋Coleman。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go, be with that douchebag Coleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.11,0:40:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不在乎。我只想让你开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care. I just want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.74,0:40:46.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-Quinn，听我说。  -别困在这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Quinn, listen to me.   -Just don't get stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.91,0:40:49.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，好吗？Quinn……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, okay? Quinn...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.08,0:40:54.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你被开除了。开除了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're fired. Fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.99,0:40:56.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Coleman知道了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Coleman knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.79,0:40:59.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.96,0:41:02.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于Mary……那些封口费和掩盖的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A-about Mary... The payouts and the cover-ups
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.86,0:41:05.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有所有的事，他准备揭发我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and everything, and he's about to expose us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.60,0:41:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉，Quinn。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so sorry, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.93,0:41:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我信任他是大错特错，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, I was so wrong to trust him,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，Quinn，我们……我们现在真的必须，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but, Quinn, we... We really just right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.14,0:41:13.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们真的必须阻止他。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We really have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.74,0:41:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Quinn，振作起来。我需要你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn, suck it up. I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.15,0:41:28.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要把那混蛋扳倒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're taking that asshole down.
